Z||000001||Will||01-10-2001||09:37 AM||||Go to AutoZone and ask for 87 Fiero upper ball joints. The ones they give you should be adjustable. They'll cost $15-20, and have a lifetime warranty! Free ball joints forever!||||reg||1
